              "text": "Incolae vīcī nōs benignē accipiunt. The people who live in the village receive us kindly."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "First declension, masculine or feminine: incola, incolae. Like nauta and agricola, a first-declension noun for a person who is often a man."
